WEBVTT

00:02.796 --> 00:04.336
[JEAN] I'll have 'em
set me up with some

00:04.416 --> 00:06.886
prime real estate
in the interior.

00:07.926 --> 00:09.636
[JEAN]
All day and night.

00:09.716 --> 00:13.016
I'll sit and sip on the
finest liquor money can buy.

00:14.846 --> 00:17.516
[JEAN] I won't care
what anyone says about it.

00:19.146 --> 00:21.316
[JEAN]
After what I've gone through.

00:21.396 --> 00:23.486
My wife and kids,
and their kids

00:23.566 --> 00:25.856
deserve to live the good life.

00:32.406 --> 00:34.286
[Knocking]

00:34.366 --> 00:36.326
Jean, it's me.

00:38.956 --> 00:40.876
[HANGE]
I'll be waiting outside.

00:43.496 --> 00:45.836
[JEAN] You didn't really
notice anything.

00:45.916 --> 00:52.216
There was nobody at the window.
Don't go. Don't think about it.

00:52.306 --> 00:54.136
Just stay put.

00:54.216 --> 00:58.436
Your place in the interior
is waiting. You've earned it.

00:59.856 --> 01:02.106
[JEAN]
Stay right here.

01:08.736 --> 01:11.736
[HANGE]
Hey, Jean. Good to see you.

01:11.826 --> 01:14.746
Mikasa filled me in
on the situation.

01:14.826 --> 01:17.036
I'm sorry I wasn't
there to help,

01:17.116 --> 01:18.826
but considering
the circumstances,

01:18.906 --> 01:21.576
you both did well.
Good work.

01:23.706 --> 01:27.126
[HANGE] Levi's alive,
but he's in pretty dire shape.

01:27.216 --> 01:30.376
He won't be fighting
anytime soon.

01:30.466 --> 01:34.056
Listen. We made contact
with some Marleyan stragglers

01:34.136 --> 01:37.266
and we've got the Cart Titan
on our side now.

01:37.346 --> 01:39.516
We're going to try to stop Eren.

01:39.596 --> 01:41.976
Killing everyone
isn't the answer.

01:43.356 --> 01:45.816
What do you think
you can do to stop him?

01:45.896 --> 01:48.816
[HANGE] First off,
we have to find more allies.

01:48.896 --> 01:50.486
Our ultimate strategy
will depend on

01:50.566 --> 01:52.406
who we have to work with,

01:52.486 --> 01:53.906
but I doubt we'll be
able to accomplish

01:53.986 --> 01:55.486
anything without
at least you guys,

01:55.576 --> 01:57.286
plus a few more of the Nine.

01:57.366 --> 02:00.326
It's safe to say our military
is effectively dissolved.

02:00.406 --> 02:03.336
I'm not anybody's superior,
and I can't give you orders.

02:03.416 --> 02:04.706
I can only ask you
for help and--

02:04.786 --> 02:05.836
[MIKASA]
I'll do it.

02:05.916 --> 02:08.126
Eren's killed too many already.

02:08.216 --> 02:11.296
I won't sit back and
watch him steal more lives.

02:11.376 --> 02:13.386
I know he's doing what
he believes he has to do

02:13.466 --> 02:15.136
to protect us and the island,

02:15.216 --> 02:17.516
but I can't let him
go through with it.

02:18.716 --> 02:20.136
[HANGE]
Mikasa.

02:21.686 --> 02:25.726
[JEAN] Think. Let's say we
figure out a way to stop Eren.

02:25.816 --> 02:27.526
What comes after that?

02:28.936 --> 02:31.106
[JEAN] Assuming he lives,
he's got the power

02:31.196 --> 02:33.736
of the Founder
for four more years.

02:33.816 --> 02:36.446
What do we do once he's gone?

02:36.526 --> 02:39.366
We're still monsters
in the eyes of the world,

02:39.446 --> 02:42.616
and after this, they'll only
be more terrified of us.

02:42.706 --> 02:44.166
If we stop Eren now,

02:44.246 --> 02:48.046
we're guaranteeing the
destruction of this island.

02:48.126 --> 02:50.006
[HANGE]
Here's how I see it.

02:50.086 --> 02:51.756
Marley will presume
that even if they

02:51.836 --> 02:53.836
hit us with another
surprise attack,

02:53.926 --> 02:55.756
we can respond
with the rumbling,

02:55.846 --> 02:58.176
and that threat will be enough
to keep them off our backs

02:58.256 --> 03:00.346
for the time being.

03:00.426 --> 03:02.556
"If we don't exterminate
the island devils now,

03:02.636 --> 03:03.976
it's only a matter
of time before

03:04.056 --> 03:06.566
they come here
and destroy us all."

03:06.646 --> 03:08.606
You remember
Willy Tybur's speech.

03:08.686 --> 03:11.316
What's the world gonna do
when we prove him right?

03:11.396 --> 03:13.486
[HANGE]
Nothing good, I know.

03:13.566 --> 03:16.276
But at the very least,
this buys us a bit more time

03:16.366 --> 03:18.116
to try to figure out
a better way.

03:18.196 --> 03:21.406
Better way? We've spent years
looking for a better way

03:21.496 --> 03:23.076
and this is where
it's gotten us!

03:23.156 --> 03:25.536
We did our best and now
we've run out of time!

03:25.626 --> 03:27.876
That's the reason
Eren decided to--

03:27.956 --> 03:30.246
[HANGE]
What he's doing is wrong!

03:32.086 --> 03:35.046
It's genocide, and I'll
be damned if I'm gonna

03:35.126 --> 03:38.596
sit here and listen to you
try to justify it!

03:42.556 --> 03:43.846
[HANGE]
I'm sorry.

03:43.936 --> 03:46.646
I shouldn't have
raised my voice.

03:46.726 --> 03:49.686
Honestly, I don't think you're
wrong about what you said, Jean.

03:49.776 --> 03:52.646
It was my hollow idealism
that drove Eren to do this.

03:52.736 --> 03:55.816
What's more, before he
brought down the walls,

03:55.906 --> 03:58.406
I wanted nothing more
than to run away.

03:58.486 --> 04:02.496
I was gonna give up the fight
and cling to life at all costs,

04:02.576 --> 04:04.406
but I couldn't,

04:04.496 --> 04:07.536
because I'm still Commander
of the Survey Corps.

04:07.626 --> 04:11.496
I can feel the eyes of our
fallen comrades watching me.

04:11.586 --> 04:15.466
Everyone who gave their hearts
and souls to set humanity free.

04:15.546 --> 04:17.506
Most of them died
too soon to learn that

04:17.586 --> 04:21.056
past our walls,
humankind lived on.

04:21.136 --> 04:22.676
But if they'd known,
would they want to

04:22.766 --> 04:26.686
set our island free and
let the rest of the world burn?

04:26.766 --> 04:29.896
Can you imagine any of them
being that selfish?

04:31.766 --> 04:35.236
We'll only get one chance
to stop the slaughter.

04:35.316 --> 04:36.946
And this is it.

04:44.156 --> 04:45.956
[Gasps]

04:50.916 --> 04:57.926
[JEAN] Hange. In the end,
I'll always be a Scout.

05:22.196 --> 05:24.996
So is anybody gonna
help me out with these potatoes?

05:25.076 --> 05:27.196
Or we just gonna
glare at each other?

05:28.286 --> 05:29.666
[MAGATH]
We've gone from trading blows

05:29.746 --> 05:32.746
to breaking bread
inside of a day, huh?

05:32.836 --> 05:37.086
Out of curiosity, what made
you change your minds?

05:37.166 --> 05:39.006
If you let Eren Jaeger succeed,

05:39.086 --> 05:42.676
you'll be getting far more than
you ever could have hoped for.

05:42.756 --> 05:46.266
You island devils will have
the world to yourselves.

05:46.346 --> 05:48.556
We were the ones
trying to save it.

05:48.636 --> 05:49.636
We would have been able to keep

05:49.726 --> 05:52.106
Eren and Zeke
from coming into contact

05:52.186 --> 05:55.186
if you hadn't stepped in at
the last second and helped them.

05:55.266 --> 05:58.606
[HANGE] I'm only repeating what
I already told you, General,

05:58.686 --> 06:01.816
but nobody here wants to be
an accessory to genocide.

06:01.906 --> 06:04.576
That's why we're all hiding out
in the woods eating stew

06:04.656 --> 06:07.286
instead of celebrating in town.

06:07.366 --> 06:10.666
[MAGATH] So you finally figured
out who the good guys are, huh?

06:10.746 --> 06:12.626
Are you kidding me?

06:12.706 --> 06:16.876
You seriously think you're
in the right? You're crazy.

06:16.956 --> 06:19.046
You people spent years
trying to murder us all,

06:19.126 --> 06:22.046
and we're the bad guys 'cause
we didn't roll over and die?

06:22.126 --> 06:24.386
Screw that! We learned to
fight like hell because

06:24.466 --> 06:25.756
the only other option we had was

06:25.846 --> 06:27.766
to let your Titans
eat us all alive!

06:27.846 --> 06:28.976
We found a way to survive,

06:29.056 --> 06:31.686
and now you're gonna
call us devils for it?

06:33.146 --> 06:34.306
That's right.

06:34.396 --> 06:37.066
You're exactly what we
always thought you were.

06:37.146 --> 06:39.896
We let you fester
for too long on Paradis.

06:39.986 --> 06:42.066
The world's about to
pay for that mistake.

06:42.146 --> 06:43.486
You finally won your freedom,

06:43.566 --> 06:45.826
and we can all see
what you're doing with it.

06:45.906 --> 06:47.446
What'd I miss?

06:47.536 --> 06:50.036
[JEAN] Plenty. Not a word
about your shock troops

06:50.116 --> 06:51.496
destroying Eren's home
and making him

06:51.576 --> 06:53.496
watch his mother
get eaten alive!

06:53.576 --> 06:56.086
That's what started this!

06:56.166 --> 06:57.586
If you wanna know
why this is happening,

06:57.666 --> 06:59.086
go look in a mirror!

06:59.166 --> 07:04.176
Right. Everything was fine
'til your buddy lost his mom.

07:04.256 --> 07:06.506
I guess all those centuries
of Marley's people

07:06.596 --> 07:08.506
getting ground under
Eldia's heel don't count

07:08.596 --> 07:10.226
for anything in your mind.

07:10.306 --> 07:11.596
[JEAN] Now you're gonna
play the victim over

07:11.686 --> 07:14.346
something that happened
two thousand years ago?

07:14.436 --> 07:16.226
[MAGATH]
It's like talking to a child.

07:16.316 --> 07:18.856
It started two
thousand years ago.

07:18.936 --> 07:20.486
Compared to the sum
of the carnage

07:20.566 --> 07:21.986
and misery wrought by Eldia,

07:22.066 --> 07:24.946
your island's suffering
is a joke.

07:26.446 --> 07:28.326
[JEAN]
Excuse me?

07:31.786 --> 07:34.786
[HANGE]
Okay. That's enough.

07:34.876 --> 07:36.416
If we're gonna be
at each other's throats,

07:36.496 --> 07:37.876
let's stick to
arguing about stuff

07:37.956 --> 07:39.876
we lived through ourselves.

07:39.956 --> 07:41.376
Look, Jean.

07:41.456 --> 07:43.336
Our friend the general is
having a hard time understanding

07:43.426 --> 07:46.046
why we're not acting like
the devils we are.

07:46.136 --> 07:47.256
Giving up our paradise

07:47.346 --> 07:49.306
to save a world
that wants us dead?

07:49.386 --> 07:50.766
What devil in their right mind

07:50.846 --> 07:52.926
would do a ridiculous
thing like that?

07:53.016 --> 07:55.646
Have we gone mad?

07:55.726 --> 07:57.356
What he doesn't know

07:57.436 --> 08:00.516
is we Scouts spent a few months
living in that world,

08:00.606 --> 08:01.896
so we can never go back to being

08:01.986 --> 08:04.526
the ignorant island
devils we were.

08:10.656 --> 08:11.986
[ANNIE]
Tell me,

08:12.076 --> 08:14.496
can you honestly
bring yourself to kill him?

08:19.626 --> 08:22.126
Are you truly ready
to kill Eren?

08:26.006 --> 08:27.426
I don't think that's
our only option.

08:27.506 --> 08:29.096
We can find another way.

08:29.176 --> 08:31.966
[ANNIE] Exactly what
I expected you to say.

08:32.056 --> 08:35.306
So what, you're gonna
try and persuade him?

08:35.386 --> 08:37.306
He made the choice
to slaughter every man,

08:37.396 --> 08:39.226
woman, and child on the planet.

08:39.306 --> 08:41.316
You think you can
talk him back from that?

08:41.396 --> 08:43.276
Well, I'm not assuming we can,

08:43.356 --> 08:45.736
but we're never gonna know
for sure unless we try.

08:45.816 --> 08:48.156
[ANNIE]
Sure. And say you fail.

08:48.236 --> 08:51.616
You make your case and he still
refuses to stop the rumbling.

08:51.696 --> 08:52.986
What's next?

08:53.076 --> 08:54.656
It's him or the world.

08:54.746 --> 08:57.116
Can you all see him
as your enemy?

09:00.416 --> 09:01.916
That's what I thought.

09:01.996 --> 09:04.126
We're the ones fighting to
protect our homeland now,

09:04.206 --> 09:06.376
and we're going to do
what we need to do.

09:06.466 --> 09:08.586
But if we have to
kill Eren to save Marley,

09:08.676 --> 09:09.756
you're going to turn on us

09:09.836 --> 09:12.886
to try to save your friend
and you know it.

09:13.926 --> 09:15.346
[ANNIE]
Don't you, Mikasa?

09:15.426 --> 09:17.596
Tell me I'm wrong.

09:17.686 --> 09:19.096
You can't do it, right?

09:19.186 --> 09:21.356
You care about
nothing more than him.

09:21.436 --> 09:23.936
Can you imagine
turning against him?

09:25.146 --> 09:28.156
If you want me out of the way,
then just come out and say it.

09:29.856 --> 09:30.776
[Gasps]

09:30.866 --> 09:32.156
Leonhart!

09:47.416 --> 09:50.336
[ANNIE ] I know exactly
how you feel, Mikasa.

09:50.426 --> 09:51.586
I'm not fighting Eren because

09:51.676 --> 09:54.256
I think the world's
worth saving.

09:54.346 --> 09:56.346
I'm doing it because
my dad's in Marley

09:56.426 --> 09:59.016
and I don't want him to die,

09:59.096 --> 10:02.226
but I can't save him
without your help.

10:02.306 --> 10:06.066
If you really can change Eren's
mind, that's fine with me.

10:06.146 --> 10:10.026
But until you get the chance,
we shouldn't be fighting.

10:18.576 --> 10:20.116
[MIKASA]
Okay.

10:21.036 --> 10:22.826
[Clanking]

10:22.916 --> 10:25.246
[HANGE] Glad you worked
that out! And look!

10:25.336 --> 10:28.416
Our stew's good
to go now. Dig in!

10:31.296 --> 10:32.926
[HANGE]
Even with the horses rested,

10:33.006 --> 10:35.426
we've got a five-hour
ride to the port.

10:35.506 --> 10:37.596
From what Kiyomi told me,

10:37.676 --> 10:40.266
the Azumabito have
a flying boat in the harbor,

10:40.346 --> 10:41.476
and they'd been
planning to take off

10:41.556 --> 10:43.896
and observe the rumbling
from the air.

10:43.976 --> 10:47.146
We can use that to get close
to the Founding Titan.

10:47.226 --> 10:48.476
[MAGATH]
I knew it.

10:48.566 --> 10:51.356
The Azumabito were
helping you behind the scenes.

10:51.446 --> 10:54.616
[HANGE] The problem is, we have
to find the Founder first,

10:54.696 --> 10:57.616
and we won't have enough fuel
to fly around looking for him.

10:57.696 --> 11:00.706
[MAGATH] Right, which is why
we captured this one.

11:00.786 --> 11:04.286
Now, where is
Jaeger going first?

11:04.376 --> 11:06.376
[YELENA]
I don't know.

11:06.456 --> 11:10.586
And if I did, what reason
would I have to tell you?

11:10.666 --> 11:12.926
[MAGATH] He learned about
the mainland from you.

11:13.006 --> 11:15.926
You gave him the knowledge
to plan this attack.

11:16.006 --> 11:17.426
He's going to be
picking his targets

11:17.506 --> 11:19.386
based on what you taught him.

11:19.466 --> 11:22.186
You should at least
be able to make a guess.

11:22.266 --> 11:23.556
[YELENA]
Kiss my ass.

11:23.646 --> 11:24.726
[MAGATH]
Hm?

11:26.476 --> 11:28.476
What makes you think
I'll reverse course now

11:28.566 --> 11:30.106
and help you Marleyan swine save

11:30.186 --> 11:32.396
your godforsaken
hellhole of a country?

11:32.486 --> 11:33.606
How about the fact
that it's your

11:33.696 --> 11:35.776
only chance of
seeing another sunrise?

11:35.866 --> 11:38.906
That won't work,
she doesn't wanna live.

11:38.986 --> 11:40.536
But I thought you
started the Volunteers

11:40.616 --> 11:43.286
'cause you wanted to liberate
your homeland from Marley.

11:43.366 --> 11:44.866
Are ya gonna let
your country get flattened

11:44.956 --> 11:47.456
just to spite the
"Marleyan Swine"?

11:48.376 --> 11:50.086
It's a fair question.

11:50.166 --> 11:54.296
[MAGATH] The answer's "yes."
Wanna know why?

11:54.376 --> 11:58.386
Because she's a purebred
Marleyan pig, herself.

12:00.966 --> 12:02.426
[PIECK TITAN]
You really caught us off guard

12:02.516 --> 12:05.396
with the Liberio raid, Yelena.

12:07.476 --> 12:11.646
But we got a bigger surprise
when we looked into your past.

12:11.726 --> 12:14.856
You were born and raised
in a typical Marleyan family,

12:14.946 --> 12:18.486
but you wrote yourself a new
life story when you met Zeke.

12:18.566 --> 12:21.656
One where you were from
an annexed territory.

12:21.736 --> 12:23.696
As you grew disillusioned
with Marley,

12:23.786 --> 12:26.286
the story got more elaborate.

12:26.366 --> 12:28.326
It evolved into
a grand fantasy about

12:28.416 --> 12:31.706
saving the world with
your prince, and in time,

12:31.796 --> 12:32.876
you hoped your fairy tale would

12:32.956 --> 12:35.426
find its way into
the history books.

12:35.506 --> 12:38.836
Your commitment to the lie
is honestly impressive.

12:46.516 --> 12:50.146
[YELENA] "Save the world."
Those might be the sweetest,

12:50.226 --> 12:52.476
most alluring words
a person could hear,

12:52.566 --> 12:54.066
don't you think?

12:55.316 --> 12:57.276
[YELENA] Who wouldn't
want to imagine themselves

12:57.356 --> 13:01.326
as the savior of hundreds of
millions of innocent lives?

13:01.406 --> 13:03.866
To wash the bitterness of
hatred out of their mouths

13:03.946 --> 13:06.576
with the honeyed taste
of righteousness?

13:06.666 --> 13:09.206
From where I sit,
it looks like that's exactly

13:09.286 --> 13:12.376
what all of you are
doing right now.

13:13.626 --> 13:17.716
Seems to me you need to
have your memories jogged.

13:25.096 --> 13:27.346
[YELENA]
Reiner Braun.

13:27.436 --> 13:30.266
You were the one who breached
Shiganshina's inner gate.

13:30.346 --> 13:32.316
Do you know how many
Eldians were devoured

13:32.396 --> 13:34.856
by Pure Titans because of that?

13:36.736 --> 13:38.986
[YELENA]
And Annie Leonhart.

13:39.066 --> 13:40.736
I hear you killed
more than a few

13:40.816 --> 13:43.406
Survey Corps members
in your time,

13:43.486 --> 13:45.286
and that's before we
get into all the innocents

13:45.366 --> 13:48.576
you trampled trying to fight
your way out of Stohess.

13:49.496 --> 13:53.246
[YELENA] But let's not forget
the brave liberators of Paradis.

13:54.126 --> 13:56.626
[YELENA] There's Armin,
the levelheaded one,

13:56.706 --> 13:59.426
who seems far too kind to
cause the sort of bloodbath

13:59.506 --> 14:01.926
he did at that harbor in Marley.

14:02.006 --> 14:04.886
How high do you think
you could stack those corpses?

14:04.966 --> 14:08.346
Don't forget the civilians.
There were plenty.

14:09.386 --> 14:11.896
[YELENA] Not to sell
the rest of you short.

14:11.976 --> 14:15.276
Everyone gave a heroic
performance in Liberio.

14:15.356 --> 14:17.526
Jean, most of all.

14:17.606 --> 14:19.196
Little Falco here threw himself

14:19.276 --> 14:21.446
in front of you
to protect the Cart,

14:21.526 --> 14:23.156
but you didn't
let that stop you from

14:23.236 --> 14:25.536
firing your thunder spear,
did you?

14:25.616 --> 14:27.236
And of course.

14:27.326 --> 14:29.826
You thought you'd all
made it out clean

14:29.916 --> 14:32.826
until Gabi gunned down Sasha.

14:32.916 --> 14:35.336
What a sweetheart that girl was.

14:35.416 --> 14:38.086
Even I couldn't help
but feel sad for her.

14:39.256 --> 14:41.216
[YELENA]
And to you, she was family!

14:41.296 --> 14:43.176
You went through
training together.

14:43.256 --> 14:45.006
Went through hell together!

14:45.096 --> 14:48.806
Losing her must have been more
painful than I could imagine.

14:51.436 --> 14:54.686
This stew's pretty good, Hange.
Got enough for seconds?

14:54.766 --> 14:57.526
Oh, we've got more than enough,
so don't be shy.

15:00.816 --> 15:03.606
I wanna thank you
for this, Yelena.

15:03.696 --> 15:05.526
You're baiting us into
airing out our grudges

15:05.616 --> 15:07.036
so we can get it
out of our systems

15:07.116 --> 15:10.076
and get our heads
on straight, right?

15:10.156 --> 15:11.916
You'd have had someone
to vent to yourself,

15:11.996 --> 15:14.036
if you hadn't blown
all your friends' brains out

15:14.126 --> 15:15.956
to keep your fantasy alive.

15:16.036 --> 15:17.126
Now you've got
nothing but a head

15:17.206 --> 15:19.796
full of cutting remarks
and a death wish.

15:20.966 --> 15:26.046
Ahh. So this is actually
pretty selfless of you.

15:29.016 --> 15:32.186
[YELENA]
Right. Almost forgot.

15:32.266 --> 15:34.516
You had mentioned another name.

15:34.596 --> 15:36.106
He was already dead
by the time we met,

15:36.186 --> 15:38.856
but I remember you said
you were good friends.

15:38.936 --> 15:41.736
What was it? Marco.

15:44.696 --> 15:46.486
As I recall.

15:46.566 --> 15:48.036
You told me Annie had something

15:48.116 --> 15:51.156
to do with his death,
didn't you?

15:51.246 --> 15:53.616
Did you ever ask her
for details?

15:53.706 --> 15:55.416
I bet she'll tell you.

15:59.496 --> 16:01.046
I stole his ODM gear

16:01.126 --> 16:04.046
and left him where the Titans
could get to him.

16:04.126 --> 16:05.546
Marco got eaten because of me--

16:05.636 --> 16:08.806
Annie was only following
the orders I was giving her.

16:13.686 --> 16:15.646
[REINER]
During the fight in Trost,

16:15.726 --> 16:19.856
Marco overheard me and Bertholdt
discussing something secret.

16:19.936 --> 16:22.776
If we'd let him go,
he could've exposed us,

16:22.856 --> 16:25.656
so we decided
we had to silence him.

16:25.736 --> 16:26.946
We figured nobody
would think twice

16:27.026 --> 16:29.946
about a Scout getting
eaten by a Titan.

16:30.036 --> 16:34.246
So I tackled him onto a roof
and I pinned him down,

16:34.326 --> 16:37.456
and I ordered Annie
to strip off his ODM gear.

16:37.536 --> 16:40.126
Then. We just left him there.

16:41.166 --> 16:43.716
Marco was stranded on
that rooftop without a rig,

16:43.796 --> 16:45.586
and a Titan got to him.

16:53.306 --> 16:55.096
So did he--

16:55.176 --> 16:58.096
Did he say anything
before he was killed?

16:59.226 --> 17:01.776
[REINER] He asked why I wasn't
willing to talk to him.

17:02.606 --> 17:05.816
[JEAN] I think that
question still applies.

17:05.896 --> 17:07.656
We haven't been willing to talk.

17:07.736 --> 17:09.986
We all just started fighting

17:10.066 --> 17:12.576
and assumed it had
to be to the death.

17:13.746 --> 17:15.906
[HANGE]
But we can still change that.

17:15.996 --> 17:18.616
A little while ago, we were
all ready to kill each other,

17:18.706 --> 17:21.666
and now, here we are, talking.

17:21.746 --> 17:24.006
It's something, right?

17:24.086 --> 17:26.716
To think we'd all be
sitting around a campfire

17:26.796 --> 17:30.256
sharing a meal with people
we once called enemies.

17:33.846 --> 17:37.176
I stood and watched the Titan
as it devoured Marco,

17:37.266 --> 17:38.516
and then a switch flipped,

17:38.596 --> 17:40.596
and I couldn't figure out
why it was happening.

17:40.686 --> 17:41.436
Huh?

17:41.516 --> 17:42.766
[REINER]
I just snapped.

17:42.856 --> 17:46.146
I flew into a rage,
hellbent on avenging Marco.

17:46.236 --> 17:47.896
I cut down the Titan myself.

17:47.986 --> 17:49.276
We get it, Reiner.

17:49.356 --> 17:51.026
You're saying the guilt
of carrying out your mission

17:51.116 --> 17:52.326
screwed with your head.

17:52.406 --> 17:56.456
[REINER] Don't forgive me.
I'm truly worthless.

17:56.536 --> 17:58.746
[JEAN]
I said we get it.

18:01.166 --> 18:02.536
[REINER]
I'm sorry.

18:11.046 --> 18:17.886
[JEAN grunting]

18:20.016 --> 18:21.186
--[CONNY] Hey! Jean!
--[ARMIN] Get off him!

18:21.266 --> 18:23.646
[JEAN grunting]

18:23.726 --> 18:24.816
[CONNY]
Easy, man!

18:24.896 --> 18:25.646
[ARMIN]
Stop!

18:25.726 --> 18:27.736
[Yells]

18:30.026 --> 18:31.406
[ALL gasp]

18:31.486 --> 18:32.696
[FALCO]
Gabi!

18:37.496 --> 18:39.036
[GABI]
I'm sorry.

18:39.116 --> 18:43.996
We came here to kill
everyone on Paradis.

18:44.116 --> 18:47.996
We wanted to stage
a massacre. No prisoners.

18:48.916 --> 18:50.546
We thought the world
might forgive us

18:50.626 --> 18:54.346
for the sins of the Eldian
Empire if we wiped you out.

18:54.426 --> 18:56.306
They'd recognize us
as good Eldians

18:56.386 --> 18:58.726
who saved them from
the island devils.

18:58.806 --> 19:03.766
And now, my mom and dad,
and everyone back in Liberio.

19:03.846 --> 19:07.356
I'm gonna lose them all
because of what I did.

19:07.436 --> 19:09.316
I'm sorry.

19:10.196 --> 19:11.816
[ALL gasp]

19:12.946 --> 19:14.276
[GABI]
I understand I have no right

19:14.366 --> 19:16.116
to ask anything of any of you,

19:16.196 --> 19:19.576
but we can't save our families
without your help.

19:19.656 --> 19:21.076
So please.

19:21.156 --> 19:24.326
Please don't let
our homes get trampled.

19:24.416 --> 19:26.456
I'm begging you!

19:31.506 --> 19:33.006
Help us, please.

19:33.086 --> 19:36.256
We have to stop
the rumbling together!

19:36.346 --> 19:37.886
We're begging you!

19:37.966 --> 19:39.216
We're begging you!

19:39.306 --> 19:40.596
[GABI]
We're begging you!

19:40.676 --> 19:41.516
[FALCO]
We're begging you!

19:41.596 --> 19:43.096
[GABI]
We're begging you!

19:43.186 --> 19:44.396
[FALCO]
We're begging you!

19:44.476 --> 19:45.726
[JEAN]
Let go.

19:50.736 --> 19:52.146
[CONNY]
Where are you going, Jean?

19:52.236 --> 19:55.486
[HANGE] Hey! Wait, I just
poured you a fresh bowl!

19:56.946 --> 20:00.156
It didn't work.
We couldn't convince him.

20:06.126 --> 20:07.536
Gabi.

20:13.466 --> 20:14.966
[LEVI]
Please shut up.

20:26.766 --> 20:27.976
[JEAN]
Wake up.

20:32.356 --> 20:34.486
[JEAN]
We need to get moving.

20:34.566 --> 20:36.986
Wait, you're really
gonna help us?

20:37.066 --> 20:39.446
Of course. Let's go.

20:42.076 --> 20:44.616
[JEAN] Get your mopey ass
up already, Reiner!

20:44.706 --> 20:47.916
Your stupid face
fixed itself hours ago!

20:58.926 --> 21:03.596
[JEAN] Gabi. I'm sorry
about kicking you.

21:03.676 --> 21:04.766
You okay?

21:04.846 --> 21:08.266
I'm tougher than I
might look. It's fine.

21:08.346 --> 21:09.896
I'm glad.

21:11.226 --> 21:14.776
[JEAN] Reiner. You're not
getting an apology.

21:16.776 --> 21:19.276
Yeah, well. I'm good with that.

21:21.656 --> 21:23.156
How about me?

21:29.956 --> 21:31.796
Here comes the Cart.

21:31.876 --> 21:34.546
[MAGATH]
Stop. There's a problem.

21:38.376 --> 21:39.836
It's the harbor.

21:39.926 --> 21:41.556
The Jaegerists beat us there.

21:41.636 --> 21:43.466
They've captured it.

21:43.556 --> 21:45.976
They must have gotten one of
the trains up and running.

21:46.056 --> 21:47.436
There are tons of
soldiers posted

21:47.516 --> 21:50.976
all over the port in
full anti-Titan gear.

22:09.956 --> 22:14.956
♪ Ending Song ♪

23:41.756 --> 23:45.636
[NARRATOR] To save the world,
they must stop Eren.

23:45.716 --> 23:47.596
With their doubts vanquished,

23:47.676 --> 23:51.846
only their former allies
stand in their way.

23:51.926 --> 23:54.436
Next episode: "Traitor."
